// A drive-in theater at the edge of town: a big screen at the back of the lot facing the
// road (it glows from dusk, so it shows from the freeway), rows of speaker posts, a snack bar
// with the projection booth in it, a ticket booth under a canopy at the drive, a marquee by
// the road. Grounded. Kit format: crates/world/src/landmarks.rs and
// docs/adr/0007-landmark-kits.md. Kit frame, m: x across the lot (to the right seen from the
// road), y up, z toward the road; the lot spans x -40..40 and z -80..0.
Kit(
    id: "drive_in",
    about: "A drive-in theater: a big screen facing the road, speaker posts, a snack bar and a marquee.",
    tone: Grounded,
    lot: (80.0, 80.0),
    ground: Some("pad"),
    paints: [
        ("pad", (color: Shade(Sand, 170), surface: Asphalt)),
